   134→      return false;
   135→    }
   136→  },
   137→
   138→  /**
   139→   * Configure notifications for group chats (rooms with >2 members)
   140→   * Uses the .m.rule.room_one_to_one underride rule
   141→   */
   142→  setGroupChatNotifications: async (
